      "sourceTextSha256": "ad81f57e091ea9da97a469f78757fdd725ca17027d794984434ebdd75fd5c11a",
      "text": "In the morning you have a guided tour that includes visits to the main Colonial attractions such as the Main Square with the Cathedral, San Francisco Convent, and many elegant buildings with their traditional wooden balconies, which had been restored. Afterwards you will visit Lima’s residential areas: San Isidro with its Olive Grove, Country Club and Golf course and Miraflores with its Central Park, City Hall and Main shopping streets such as Larco Avenue.\n\nTransfer to the airport for your international flight back home!",
